# xAI's plan usage, in its usage panel.

## Setup: how to find each value the provider reads. Setting names,
## environment variables, URLs, cookie and header names, and the
## service's own menu paths stay as written.

usage-xai-setting-api-key = 从 https://console.x.ai 的设置 > Management Keys 获取的 Management API 密钥，需要账单读取权限。不接受推理 API 密钥。
usage-xai-setting-team-id = 用于计费的 xAI 团队 ID，可在 xAI Console URL 和团队设置中查看。Management 密钥必须属于此团队。

## The report: the team's prepaid balance and its spend over the last 30
## days.

usage-xai-prepaid-balance = 预付余额
# The plan line: the report comes from xAI's Management API.
usage-xai-management-api = Management API
usage-xai-spend = 花费
usage-xai-today = 今天
usage-xai-last-30-days = 过去 30 天
# The same, when some days of the history were missing.
usage-xai-last-30-days-partial = 过去 30 天（部分）
